               <li><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt text-blue-600 mr-2"></i> <strong>Borough:</strong> Bronx</li>
               <li><i class="fas fa-heartbeat text-blue-600 mr-2"></i> <strong>Primary Pain Point:</strong> Health-related attendance issues and asthma-special ed intersections.</li>
